{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glukhovo is a first person psychological horror game, featuring disturbing gameplay and an unsettling and compelling narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting your grandfather in the remote village where you spent your childhood. Sounds great, doesn't it? But this doesn't bode well for indie horror. Returning to his native village, Marlen will have to relive his childhood fears and past regrets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure awaits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each of us has our own Glukhovo. A long-abandoned place from your childhood. Sometimes your younger memories come flooding back and you feel like you need to see the place again. So Marlen decided to go to his native village to visit his grandfather, whom he had not seen for 10 years. While exploring the abandoned village, you will get to know its inhabitants, who left an indelible mark on Marlen\u2019s life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is somewhere nearby.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Regrets and fears create monsters. Ghosts of the past await you in every dark corner. To escape from them, you will have to be smart. Otherwise -  try again. But don't worry, you can always save the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror without notes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A photo album is like a monument to a person. This is the story of their life. Looking at old photographs you can learn a lot about a person. Collect all the photos in an album and find out what happened to the people in the photographs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have a piece of paper and a pen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game contains various puzzles. Some are easy to solve, while others will require you to rack your brains.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/773180?t=1768639180","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/773180?t=1768639180","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768639180","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768639180","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not suitable for all ages: Blood, Violence, General Mature Content "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Glukhovo is a first person psychological horror game, featuring disturbing gameplay and an unsettling and compelling narrative. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visiting your grandfather in the remote village where you spent your childhood. Sounds great, doesn't it? But this doesn't bode well for indie horror. Returning to his native village, Marlen will have to relive his childhood fears and past regrets. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Adventure awaits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/c60489b9d45b9aab25bcdd15a9220d80.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Each of us has our own Glukhovo. A long-abandoned place from your childhood. Sometimes your younger memories come flooding back and you feel like you need to see the place again. So Marlen decided to go to his native village to visit his grandfather, whom he had not seen for 10 years. While exploring the abandoned village, you will get to know its inhabitants, who left an indelible mark on Marlen\u2019s life. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Death is somewhere nearby.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/41b0e45eab7b620944fa7fcaab3b7d91.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Regrets and fears create monsters. Ghosts of the past await you in every dark corner. To escape from them, you will have to be smart. Otherwise -  try again. But don't worry, you can always save the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror without notes.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/6793c260c8c8b3dc4848d2c76b679cc1.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>A photo album is like a monument to a person. This is the story of their life. Looking at old photographs you can learn a lot about a person. Collect all the photos in an album and find out what happened to the people in the photographs. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Have a piece of paper and a pen.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.poster.avif?t=1768639180\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.webm?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/extras/5304a70d4ae820133ca30df5b7dd470e.mp4?t=1768639180\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The game contains various puzzles. Some are easy to solve, while others will require you to rack your brains.</p>","developers":["KomKon Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/773180/cb29412cefbf2e623065e9b1e43fbe4398b53644/header.jpg?t=1768639180","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/773180/850637/847ff940c3a745cb251427b04318d6318f168d1e/1751143001/dash_av1.mpd?t=1741888024","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/773180/850637/847ff940c3a745cb251427b04318d6318f168d1e/1751143001/dash_h264.mpd?t=1741888024","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/773180/850637/847ff940c3a745cb251427b